@startuml SequenceDiagram
title Team-9 Banking Management System - UML Sequence Diagram (Money Transfer Flow)

autonumber
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor Customer as "Bank Customer" #LightSkyBlue
participant Client as "Client UI (React/Next.js)" #LightYellow
participant Action as "Banking Action Engine" #LightGreen
participant Prisma as "Prisma ORM" #Wheat
database DB as "PostgreSQL Database" #LightCyan
participant Notif as "Notification Dispatcher" #MistyRose

Customer -> Client : 1. Enters recipient UPI ID (e.g. priya@bank)
Client -> Action : 2. resolveRecipientAction("priya@bank")
Action -> Prisma : 3. findUnique({ upiId: "priya@bank" })
Prisma -> DB : 4. SELECT * FROM "Account" WHERE "upiId" = 'priya@bank'
DB --> Prisma : 5. Returns Account and User relation
Prisma --> Action : 6. Account data
Action --> Client : 7. Return { success: true, recipientName: "Priya Sharma" }
Client --> Customer : 8. Displays green verified recipient badge

Customer -> Client : 9. Enters Amount (₹500), Category & Note
Customer -> Client : 10. Enters 6-Digit UPI PIN & clicks "Confirm & Pay"
Client -> Action : 11. transferMoneyAction(recipient, amount, pin, note)

group PostgreSQL ACID Transaction (Row-Level Locking)
  Action -> Action : 12. Verify bcrypt hash of entered 6-digit PIN
  Action -> Prisma : 13. Execute atomic prisma.$transaction
  Prisma -> DB : 14. SELECT id FROM "Account" WHERE id IN (sender, receiver) FOR UPDATE
  DB --> Prisma : 15. Row-level locks acquired deterministically
  Action -> Action : 16. Verify locked sender balance >= transfer amount
  Action -> Prisma : 17. UPDATE "Account" SET balance = balance - 500 WHERE id = sender
  Prisma -> DB : 18. Deduct sender balance
  Action -> Prisma : 19. UPDATE "Account" SET balance = balance + 500 WHERE id = receiver
  Prisma -> DB : 20. Credit receiver balance
  Action -> Prisma : 21. INSERT INTO "Transaction" (Ref: TXN-YYYYMMDD-XXXXXX)
  Prisma -> DB : 22. Record ledger row
  Action -> Prisma : 23. INSERT INTO "AuditLog" (action: "TRANSFER_EXECUTED")
  Prisma -> DB : 24. Commit ACID transaction to disk
end

Action -> Notif : 25. Dispatch in-app debit/credit alerts & email
Notif --> Action : 26. Alerts queued / logged
Action --> Client : 27. Return { success: true, referenceNumber, updatedBalance }
Client --> Customer : 28. Render Success Receipt modal & update available balance

@enduml
